Transformer Receives All Embeddings
The Transformer doesn't process one word at a time.

It processes all token embeddings together.

"Which other token embeddings should I pay attention to?"

It compares "bank" with every other token.
It finds:has a strong relationship with deposited and money So it gives them higher attention.

